        <p>COUNCIL.</p>
        <p>Thr above Council met at the WorkhouFe, Dutton, on Tws lay, when there were present :—Messrs. 5 Woodward (vice-chairman) presiding, J Melntryre, C E Linaker. J Moseley Williamg. T Bax'er, W Fletcher. E Clarke, P Leather, T Darlington. J Stks. T Wright, J B phadwick, T Lewis, H Mawdsley, Gorge Pilling, Ad- miral Jon( s Parry. E Bretherton, with George F Ashton. (clerk) ; W E Hough (deputy-clerk) ; W Digele and J Swinton (surveyors), James Farrington (inspector), and D J Adams (medical officer).</p>
